      "content": "Your sense of inner emptiness doesn't mean you were ever wrong, but it does suggest you may need to find a new path separate from your past identity, possibly through therapy or creative exploration. For now, consider that stopping the noise isn't being stuck; it is a rare moment of stillness that happens only after years of striving. It is not too late to carve a life that satisfies you deep down, even if finding that path feels terrifying right now.",
